### Chat WebSocket & REST API Testing
### Environment variables - customize as needed
@host = localhost:8080
@customerId = 1
@adminId = 2
@conversationId = 1

### ============================================
### REST ENDPOINTS - HTTP Testing
### ============================================

### Create a new conversation for customer
POST http://{{host}}/api/v1/chat/customer/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get or create current conversation for customer
GET http://{{host}}/api/v1/chat/customer/{{customerId}}/current

###

### Start or fetch the logged-in user's conversation
POST http://{{host}}/api/v1/chat/me/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get the logged-in user's current conversation
GET http://{{host}}/api/v1/chat/me/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get all conversations for a customer
GET http://{{host}}/api/v1/chat/customer/{{customerId}}

###

### Get all conversations assigned to an admin
GET http://{{host}}/api/v1/chat/admin/{{adminId}}

###

### Get assigned admin for a conversation
GET http://{{host}}/api/v1/chat/{{conversationId}}/admin

###

### Get all messages in a conversation
GET http://{{host}}/api/v1/chat/{{conversationId}}/messages

###

### Close a conversation (customer or assigned admin)
PUT http://{{host}}/api/v1/chat/{{conversationId}}/close?userId={{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Reassign conversation to another admin (admin-only)
PUT http://{{host}}/api/v1/chat/{{conversationId}}/reassign/{{adminId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###


